    "web",
    "ios",
    "print"
  ],
  "tradeDress": "Original artwork drawn for Squatch Stack. No other maker's enclosure colour, knob, lettering or footswitch treatment is copied; the round hex-nut footswitch and the two-over-one knob order are chosen to differ from the circuit's best-known ancestor.",
